<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Depreciation
expense for the three months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025 was $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20260101__20260331_zqRyrbkgtay8" title="Depreciation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-03-31" id="Fact001429" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">316</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20250101__20250331_z41O4YEFgp54" title="Depreciation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-03-31" id="Fact001431" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">0</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively. Depreciation expense for the nine months ended
March 31, 2026 and 2025 was $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20250701__20260331_zaMDAv6F1ab4" title="Depreciation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-03-31" id="Fact001433" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">670</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--Depreciation_dxL_c20240701__20250331_zXc9SMQSxxxf" title="Depreciation::XDX::-"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl1435">0</span></span>, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


