&#8211; long-term portion of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--PrepaidExpenseNoncurrent_iI_c20260316_zhXYNQpl8rO7" title="Prepaid expenses, long-term portion"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PrepaidExpenseNoncurrent" contextRef="AsOf2026-03-16" id="Fact002544" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">460,477</ix:nonFraction></span> to be amortized over the remaining terms of the respective agreements. During the nine months ended
