<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
fiscal year 2025, the Company issued an aggregate of <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_c20240701__20250630__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ConsultingInvestorRelationsAndBusinessAdvisoryServicesMember_zNNgqLAMpyse" title="Issuance of common stock for services, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2024-07-012025-06-30_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_ConsultingInvestorRelationsAndBusinessAdvisoryServicesMember" id="Fact002550" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,025,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of fully vested, non-forfeitable common stock to various consultants
