<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-03-31" escape="true" id="Fact003142" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfDerivativeLiabilitiesAtFairValueTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_89C_eus-gaap--ScheduleOfDerivativeLiabilitiesAtFairValueTableTextBlock_znjnEfhNnXc5" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
following is a roll forward for the nine months ended March 31, 2026 of the fair value liability of price adjustable derivative instruments:</span></p>

