<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
April 2026, the Company issued an aggregate of <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_c20260401__20260430__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zf0gDhz39EO6" title="Stock issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2026-04-012026-04-30_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact003166" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,100,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of its common stock as a result of the conversion of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ConversionOfStockSharesConverted1_c20260401__20260430__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesCPreferredStockMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zeyXAx5hIxn7" title="Preferred stock converted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConversionOfStockSharesConverted1" contextRef="From2026-04-012026-04-30_us-gaap_SeriesCPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact003168" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">50</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of Series
C Preferred stock during such period.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>Shares
issued for exercise of Series C Warrants</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
April 2026, the Company received aggregate gross proceeds of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromWarrantExercises_c20260401__20260430__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesCWarrantsMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zMy69RwHcPmc" title="Proceeds from exercise of warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromWarrantExercises" contextRef="From2026-04-012026-04-30_custom_SeriesCWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact003170" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">500,000</ix:nonFraction></span> from the exercise of approximately <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_c20260428__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesCWarrantsMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_z32mcXEAOKI5" title="Warrants to purchase common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2026-04-28_custom_SeriesCWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact003172" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">50</ix:nonFraction></span> Series C Warrants with an
exercise price of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_c20260428__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesCWarrantsMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zJLaqos4MEy9" title="Warrant exercise price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2026-04-28_custom_SeriesCWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact003174" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">10,000</ix:nonFraction></span> per share and issued <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--PreferredStockSharesIssued_iI_pid_c20260430__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesCPreferredStockMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_ziiakuwpx3xb" title="Number of shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesIssued" contextRef="AsOf2026-04-30_us-gaap_SeriesCPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact003176" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">50</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of Series C preferred stock.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>Shares
issued for common stock issuable</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
April 2026, the Company issued an aggregate of <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--PreferredStockConvertibleSharesIssuable_iI_c20260430__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zJrCpj5dJtB1" title="Stock issuable"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockConvertibleSharesIssuable" contextRef="AsOf2026-04-30_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact003178" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">33,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock for common stock issuable as of March 31, 2026 (see
Note 8).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>Extension
